/** @mainpage

Exercises tsf-kerberos (tapi_kerberos) from the Test Agent it runs on,
against a KDC/Active Directory supplied by the environment:

- @ref kerberos-probe - get a TGT with a principal+password and log the
  ticket (client/server, validity, session-key enctype);
- @ref kerberos-audit - read the KDC posture through tsf-cybersec and
  gate on it: a principal needing no pre-authentication (AS-REP
  roasting) and weak session-key enctypes.

The realm/KDC/principal/password come from the environment
(TSF_KRB5_*); with none set the tests skip cleanly. Authorized use
only - the tests authenticate to a real KDC.

*/
